@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Query parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hello?name=Kotlin

### Path parameter (demo data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/42

### JSON request body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Hello Ktor"}

### Validation error (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":" "}
